{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6930867960316708", "organization": {"id": "5147263378645463", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "6930867960316708"}]}, "id": "1117312429105828"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "6930867960316708", "release_date": 1664557200, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28982476394729215"}, "id": "656562575462701"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1665742536, "id": "8025608947509265", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v3", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 3, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "388166463398573"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "6930867960316708"}, "id": "388166463398573", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "6930867960316708", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "534628278422289"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "3404310493224097", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "World Flight", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Volez autour du monde sans limites avec votre casque Meta Quest 2.\n\nRessentez la libert\u00e9, voyagez n'importe o\u00f9 sur la plan\u00e8te et profitez de toute sa beaut\u00e9 et de sa diversit\u00e9.\n\n[Connexion Internet requise]\n\nTraits:\n- Planifiez votre vol sur la carte avec un puissant moteur de recherche\n- Pilotez un avion ou un h\u00e9licopt\u00e8re avec des gameplays totalement diff\u00e9rents\n- M\u00e9t\u00e9o dynamique, vent et heure de la journ\u00e9e\n- B\u00e2timents et eau g\u00e9n\u00e9r\u00e9s de mani\u00e8re proc\u00e9durale avec des donn\u00e9es r\u00e9elles\n- Profitez de certains des sites les plus c\u00e9l\u00e8bres\n- Cockpits enti\u00e8rement interactifs\n- G\u00e9rer le carburant, le vent, les volets, le train d'atterrissage et les freins\n- D\u00e9collez et atterrissez dans n'importe quel a\u00e9roport / h\u00e9liport du monde", "short_description": "Volez autour du monde sans limites avec votre casque Meta Quest 2.\n\nRessentez la libert\u00e9, voyagez n'importe o\u00f9 sur la plan\u00e8te et profitez de toute sa beaut\u00e9 et de sa diversit\u00e9.\n\n- Planifiez votre vol sur la carte avec un puissant moteur de recherche\n- Pilotez un avion ou un h\u00e9licopt\u00e8re avec des gameplays totalement diff\u00e9rents\n- M\u00e9t\u00e9o dynamique, vent et heure de la journ\u00e9e\n- B\u00e2timents et eau g\u00e9n\u00e9r\u00e9s de mani\u00e8re proc\u00e9durale avec des donn\u00e9es r\u00e9elles\n- Profitez de certains des sites les plus c\u00e9l\u00e8bres"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplatePortrait.png", "id": "4791685844287908", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75367594_4791685860954573_7257581933347926913_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a8g06gvTMMkQ7kNvwEQFjf-&_nc_oc=Adr-zDplFEX51YcCdog_2n7FAFyheKMPBRV5MX5CPcPlLJRO9bA1uap1kWjLPZl-bkY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAVenDaYI9u0wTZh-FO2jd0WW7OBH38ICwzjLxqDP3chg&oe=6A635BB0"}, {"file_name": "World Flight.png", "id": "1149785982476367", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031330_1149785989143033_1331672134240649803_n.png?_nc_cat=1